From 6b92de67849ab15b4676077fb6bb2d7f544460f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:38:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 43/51] util/disk_cache: include only what disk_cache.c uses
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

mesa-nvk-horizon: Phase 7 item 1 (Mesa shader disk cache on Horizon)
Why: disk_cache.c is the storage-agnostic half of the shader cache — key
 derivation, the put queue, compression, the statistics — and it opens
 with five system headers that belong to the other half. One of them,
 <sys/mman.h>, does not exist on this C library, so the generic half
 cannot be compiled at all on a platform that would supply its own
 backend. It does not use any of the five.
Evidence: measured on devkitA64 gcc 15.2.0 (newlib), compiling upstream's
 file verbatim with the flags this build uses:

   disk_cache.c:34:10: fatal error: sys/mman.h: No such file or directory
      34 | #include <sys/mman.h>
         |          ^~~~~~~~~~~~
   compilation terminated.

 That is the only one of the five that is missing here — <ftw.h>,
 <sys/file.h>, <fcntl.h> and <dirent.h> all resolve on this toolchain,
 checked one at a time — so removing the other four is the same cleanup
 rather than a second requirement. None of the five is used:

   $ grep -nE '\bmmap\(|\bnftw\(|\bftw\(|\bflock\(|\bopendir\(|\bopen\(|\bunlink\(|posix_fallocate|getpwuid' src/util/disk_cache.c
   (no output)

 while the same grep over disk_cache_os.c finds opendir at 244, flock at
 807, fcntl at 815, getpwuid_r at 967, posix_fallocate at 1129 and mmap
 at 1163 — every use is in the OS file, which keeps its own includes.

 <sys/types.h>, <sys/stat.h>, <errno.h>, <ctype.h>, <inttypes.h> and the
 three C89 headers stay: those are used.
Upstream: yes — it removes includes no line of the file needs, on every
 platform, and adds nothing. A compiler with all five present produces
 the same object it did before.
---
 src/util/disk_cache.c | 5 -----
 1 file changed, 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/util/disk_cache.c b/src/util/disk_cache.c
index 1f4338820dd..40bd6e58ea5 100644
--- a/src/util/disk_cache.c
+++ b/src/util/disk_cache.c
@@ -24,17 +24,12 @@
 #ifdef ENABLE_SHADER_CACHE
 
 #include <ctype.h>
-#include <ftw.h>
 #include <string.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <stdio.h>
-#include <sys/file.h>
 #include <sys/types.h>
 #include <sys/stat.h>
-#include <sys/mman.h>
-#include <fcntl.h>
 #include <errno.h>
-#include <dirent.h>
 #include <inttypes.h>
 
 #include "util/compress.h"
